# Authors

**SO-101 Visuomotor Manipulation Platform** — designed and maintained by **romil0001**.

- Repository: https://github.com/romil0001/so101-visuomotor-manipulation
- Architecture: `docs/architecture.md`

LeRobot (Hugging Face) is a third-party hardware/driver dependency cloned into
`third_party/lerobot` at install time. It is not part of this project's authorship.
